      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am completely in agreement. This type of group is typically disturbing and appears to be spam.\n\nI noticed that these invitations are sent by “trash” profiles (visitor profiles). Several of my friends have received the same group invitation from 3 to 4 different people, all with visitor status.\n\nI am to clarify that banning group invitations only works for a single specific group, and this type of “trash” invitation is what I receive in dozens each month. And even if most people ignore this notification or accept without even noticing it, it artificially inflates the number of users in these groups.\n\nI suggest group invite should be made applicable to:\n\n- Recently seen people  \n\n- People present in the world instance\n\n- Friends",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
