  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-15T22:06:49.974Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I recently (past few months) have been receiving group invites from users who I do not recognize nor have ever been in an instance with. Some of these invites I received even while I was offline. \n\nHaving the option to limit who can send a group invite to a user would prevent these spam invites. It would also be useful in public instances to block unwanted group invites from non-friended users.\n\nThanks for reading,\n\n[Cash]",
